  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the shadow of the Bldg Supply Depot, 'Socket' spent his hatchling days scavenging for scraps and avoiding the gaze of the dreaded 'Re-Beakers'. The depot's toxic runoff gave him the 'Dead-Eyes' that scare away most scavengers, but also bestowed uncanny perception that made him an invaluable asset to the Mudderflock.",
    "class": "Scavenger",
    "name": "Socket",
    "personality": "Grimly pragmatic, Socket is a survivor first and foremost. Haunted by visions granted by his 'Socket 2 Me', he often comes across as fatalistic, but his loyalty to the Mudderflock is unwavering. Beneath his hardened exterior lies a dry, sarcastic wit that he occasionally unleashes on unsuspecting flockmates.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Using his enhanced perception granted by his ocular modification, Socket can scan a 50-meter radius for hidden caches of DRIP and enemy ambushes. It has a limited number of uses per encounter before it overloads, leaving the user vulnerable.",
